If you have any issues with this scrip you can email or telegram me:
	EMAIL: CronusOmegaScripts@Gmail.com
	Telegrame: @CronusOmega



Enter and exit weapon menu - PS = L2+Start    XBOX = LT+Start
	Nagivate weapon menu:
		Up dpad - changes AR
		Down dpad - changes smg
		Left dpad - changes barrel
		Right dpad - changes optic

Enter and exit script settings - PS = L2+PS Button    XBOX = LT+Xbox Button
	Nagigate script settings menu:
		Right and left dpad - Switches to different settings
		Jump button - Select a menu
		R3 button - Exit a menu
		Up and down dpad - Switches options for selected setting

*/

